{"h":3170,"lines":[{"w":0.059765605926513699,"t":"Test 2","y":0.044741584745961904,"x":0.84055865567352273,"h":0.015167993250705503,"c":1},{"w":0.046140015920003261,"t":"ROSIE:","h":0.010370061976676448,"y":0.094378922374487306,"c":1,"x":0.086334982827883197},{"x":0.086372361119807853,"w":0.05182341575622558,"c":1,"y":0.16133720917921157,"t":"TUTOR.","h":0.0087209304424490375},{"w":0.046092255910237648,"h":0.0088029897551431535,"t":"ROSIE.","x":0.086358862351921598,"y":0.17728455161440704,"c":1},{"x":0.086372361750473817,"w":0.055662186940511074,"h":0.011627907256598791,"t":"MARTIN:","y":0.20784883695309597,"c":1},{"y":0.27180232537686866,"t":"ROSIE:","x":0.084452976201064234,"w":0.049904028574625642,"h":0.01162790725659868,"c":1},{"t":"MARTIN:","h":0.011976860599938854,"c":1,"w":0.057702846527099602,"y":0.32104645340073801,"x":0.08439233864328026},{"t":"TUTOR:","y":0.35319767442624128,"x":0.086372360230715609,"h":0.010174418548680286,"w":0.049904031753540037,"c":1},{"y":0.36918604638488017,"t":"ROSIE:","x":0.086372361602334705,"w":0.046065257390340161,"c":1,"h":0.0087209304424489265},{"y":0.38478337260196871,"t":"MARTIN.","w":0.05395480473836263,"h":0.009503022202933975,"x":0.08818574533153796,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"TUTOR:","x":0.086325765147339265,"y":0.52166459986630775,"h":0.010449869775621679,"w":0.0519166088104248},{"w":0.05576019922892253,"t":"MARTIN:","x":0.086323355737055685,"h":0.011899652089982338,"y":0.55364319706770448,"c":1},{"y":0.58575581387972964,"c":1,"x":0.088291747773160054,"t":"ROSIE:","w":0.046065257390340161,"h":0.010174418548680286},{"c":1,"h":0.011185448102018491,"x":0.086218667167699395,"y":0.61868053174598592,"t":"MARTIN:","w":0.055969575246175116},{"x":0.088291747412649335,"t":"ROSIE:","y":0.63517441861051827,"w":0.046065257390340175,"h":0.010174418548680286,"c":1},{"t":"MARTIN:","x":0.088281678609549399,"y":0.699092215368602,"h":0.0087923134162974925,"w":0.053762938181559236,"c":1},{"w":0.046065257390340175,"y":0.73110465116865786,"c":1,"x":0.088291747412649335,"h":0.010174418548680286,"t":"ROSIE:"},{"t":"TUTOR:","y":0.76308139522407148,"x":0.088291746014697456,"w":0.049904031753540037,"c":1,"h":0.0087209304424490375},{"x":0.088291746803640006,"t":"MARTIN:","y":0.77906976734266586,"w":0.053742802937825532,"h":0.010174418548680175,"c":1},{"y":0.8270348835952207,"c":1,"w":0.044145873387654633,"x":0.09021113229895214,"t":"ROSIE:","h":0.0087209304424490375},{"t":"MARTIN:","w":0.054005915323893219,"x":0.088160190384340878,"y":0.84115577284771736,"c":1,"h":0.011002407615493204},{"t":"ROSIE.","h":0.01039808255264818,"y":0.85889979591134724,"w":0.044234946568806985,"x":0.090166595717322426,"c":1},{"w":0.055791231791178397,"y":0.88935535680602062,"t":"MARTIN:","x":0.088227225300847062,"h":0.011986960522383905,"c":1},{"x":0.17839667751470273,"c":1,"t":"Yes. The tooth was found by a man called Russell Graham. He picked it up from","y":0.0908528726397686,"w":0.62017461140950525,"h":0.018807822146250208},{"x":0.17850286946773697,"t":"under a rock in a cave. He knew it was special - for a start it was in really good","y":0.11041009434076421,"w":0.61228408813476565,"h":0.016088328075709812,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.12645348832709813,"t":"condition, as if it had been just extracted from the animal's jawbone. Anyway,","x":0.18042225671977499,"w":0.59500961303710942,"h":0.01613326268241233},{"x":0.17850288197375772,"t":"they found it was 6,500 years old.","y":0.14244186058467589,"w":0.26487523396809898,"h":0.014655930913209159,"c":1},{"h":0.013249211356466839,"t":"So why was that significant?","c":1,"x":0.18234164474272138,"w":0.21880999247233071,"y":0.15835962123537328},{"c":1,"t":"Wellthe mammoth bones previously found on the North American mainland wereQ22","x":0.18042225853072003,"y":0.17441860460689407,"h":0.016117672965353491,"w":0.67370442708333322},{"w":0.42634201049804688,"y":0.18950877126789778,"c":1,"h":0.01553866870771814,"x":0.18223596231210762,"t":"much less recent than that. So this was really amazing."},{"w":0.58733205159505208,"x":0.18042226584065901,"h":0.014621084195206135,"c":1,"y":0.20630914823429714,"t":"Then we're making an animated diagram to show the geography of the area"},{"t":"in prehistoric times. So originally, St Paul's Island wasn't an island, it was","x":0.17842122100833024,"h":0.018348229345087064,"w":0.56444442749023438,"c":1,"y":0.22090877934845965},{"x":0.18042228711465441,"w":0.60076772054036454,"t":"connected to the mainland, and mammoths and other animals like bears were","h":0.014624752682466213,"c":1,"y":0.23837209296750428},{"t":"able to roam around the whole area.","y":0.25460625761069156,"x":0.18226061747650599,"h":0.012876472112132276,"c":1,"w":0.28232264200846358},{"y":0.27034700322169281,"h":0.016088328075709812,"c":1,"x":0.18042225524853714,"t":"Then the climate warmed up and the sea level began to rise, and the island got","w":0.61228408813476565},{"x":0.17843429142532075,"y":0.28547359132842742,"t":"cut off from the mainland. So those mammoths on the island couldn't escape;","h":0.016926738365967586,"w":0.60670191446940103,"c":1},{"w":0.036468327840169179,"t":"Q23","c":1,"x":0.81765835064325498,"y":0.28633720924657413,"h":0.014534883469061066},{"c":1,"y":0.3037790700558386,"t":"they had to stay on the island","x":0.17850288488903868,"w":0.23032628377278644,"h":0.013081394761142673},{"y":0.31829653018838133,"t":"And in fact the species survived there for thousands of years after they'd become","x":0.17850287930287304,"h":0.016088328075709812,"w":0.62763916015624999,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.1804222659575451,"t":"extinct on the mainland.","y":0.33564668742360415,"w":0.18618041992187498,"h":0.013249211356466839},{"c":1,"t":"So why do you think they died out on the mainland?","x":0.18234164640234657,"y":0.35173501602159518,"w":0.39923225402832035,"h":0.013090565076761762},{"c":1,"h":0.01560353300172812,"t":"No one's sure.","x":0.1801331745031097,"y":0.36537490776871961,"w":0.11579597473144529},{"t":"Anyway, next we'Il explain how Graham and his team identified the date when","y":0.38359621442467828,"x":0.1785028872288611,"h":0.014659599400469125,"c":1,"w":0.60268712361653642},{"y":0.39968454241649376,"w":0.61804224650065098,"c":1,"x":0.17850286897368534,"t":"the mammoths became extinct on the island. They concluded that the extinction","h":0.014559643501738995},{"t":"Q24","h":0.013081394761142673,"c":1,"y":0.40116279095518448,"x":0.81765834878455068,"w":0.036468331019083644},{"w":0.56248743693033854,"t":"happened 5,600 years ago, which is a very precise time for a prehistoric","h":0.015973002677460157,"c":1,"x":0.17845567391910588,"y":0.41429523683538705},{"y":0.43006194763431949,"h":0.016995765734170165,"x":0.17845224939811222,"w":0.58743662516276041,"c":1,"t":"extinction. It's based on samples they took from mud at the bottom of a lake"},{"c":1,"t":"on the island. They analysed it to find out what had fallen in over time - bits of","w":0.60472300211588537,"x":0.18036183427197366,"y":0.44619528676420794,"h":0.016558407082542637},{"h":0.014570647760144495,"y":0.46366279082124939,"c":1,"x":0.18234165687761428,"t":"plants, volcanic ash and even DNA from the mammoths themselves. It's standard","w":0.6257197570800781},{"t":"procedure, but it took nearly two years to do.","x":0.18031995619427885,"c":1,"y":0.47937070974996088,"h":0.017682080915673692,"w":0.34762959798177084},{"w":0.61228408813476554,"h":0.013089648105368612,"c":1,"t":"So why don't you quickly go through the main sections of your presentation and","x":0.18234164105737732,"y":0.5203488375010864},{"t":"discuss what action's needed for each part?","x":0.1804222654875941,"y":0.53627760267347335,"h":0.014594490219742018,"w":0.34165067036946617,"c":1},{"y":0.55232558151894651,"w":0.60076777140299475,"x":0.18042225623708219,"c":1,"t":"OK. So for the introduction, we're using a visual, so once we ve prepared that","h":0.014551390157513167},{"t":"we're done.","c":1,"h":0.012064071559003464,"w":0.092373358408610023,"y":0.56865408967347275,"x":0.18224772577826234},{"t":"I'm not sure. I think we need to write down all the ideas we want to include here.","x":0.18042227155917431,"h":0.014610079936800746,"c":1,"y":0.58422712923720765,"w":0.61996159871419265},{"x":0.18234165315971629,"y":0.60029069796473034,"c":1,"w":0.57005757649739586,"t":"not just rely on memory. How we begin the presentation is so important ...","h":0.013081394761142673},{"h":0.013081394761142673,"c":1,"w":0.036468327840169401,"x":0.81765835069123971,"t":"Q25","y":0.58284883733963222},{"y":0.63217665640028553,"c":1,"h":0.014625669052172219,"w":0.58925145467122397,"t":"The discovery of the mammoth tooth is probably the most dramatic part, but","x":0.18042225723831612},{"w":0.60862945556640624,"h":0.018533653716559573,"c":1,"t":"we don't have that much information, only what we got from the online article. I","y":0.64677396532098974,"x":0.1803428845732781},{"w":0.61240788777669275,"c":1,"h":0.015865093676449726,"t":"thought maybe we could get in touch with the researcher who led the team and","x":0.18035719337006687,"y":0.66373922138803843},{"h":0.013081394761142673,"t":"Q26","y":0.66424418629947957,"x":0.8176583487958804,"w":0.036468331019083644,"c":1},{"x":0.18042225892795424,"t":"ask him to tell us a bit more.","y":0.6816860467971958,"w":0.21880999247233071,"h":0.013081394761142673,"c":1},{"y":0.69621451112267896,"t":"Great idea. What about the section with the initial questions asked by the","w":0.56238001505533852,"h":0.013087814162582201,"c":1,"x":0.18234166224032664},{"w":0.55086369832356774,"y":0.71220930261650872,"t":"researchers? We've got a lot on that but we need to make it interesting.","h":0.013081394761142673,"x":0.18234166323410667,"c":1},{"x":0.18035312737388901,"y":0.72659578703802896,"w":0.67388727823893246,"c":1,"h":0.017546402843968689,"t":"We could ask the audience to suggest some questions about it and then see how Q27"},{"x":0.18042226520699312,"y":0.74258675102256333,"c":1,"w":0.50287907918294272,"h":0.016134179052118225,"t":"many of them we can answer. I don't think it would take too long."},{"c":1,"y":0.75898737188529508,"w":0.26701093037923174,"t":"Yes that would add a bit of variety.","h":0.014357114966359386,"x":0.18415841783715556},{"x":0.18426103703808527,"h":0.013249211356466839,"w":0.59309020996093753,"c":1,"t":"Then the section on further research carried out on the island - analysing the","y":0.77602523685488423},{"w":0.6201154581705729,"h":0.017776707068602682,"c":1,"x":0.1822702956601476,"t":"mud in the lake. I wonder if we've actually got too much information here, should","y":0.79077353362315073},{"h":0.014573398674324167,"t":"we cut some?","y":0.80813953486430667,"w":0.11132437388102212,"x":0.18234165267561175,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.8219215376818042,"w":0.39184506734212243,"x":0.18219939049624079,"h":0.017852966116053914,"t":"I don't think so, but it's all a bit muddled at present."},{"w":0.51267751057942701,"c":1,"x":0.18222783770308798,"t":"Yes, maybe it would be better if it followed a chronological pattern.","h":0.01906696704659927,"y":0.83724199839310698},{"w":0.03646832784016929,"c":1,"y":0.8372093024559113,"h":0.013081394761142673,"x":0.81957773619987695,"t":"Q28"},{"x":0.18036892435624896,"t":"I think so. The findings and possible explanations section is just about ready, but","h":0.01750037497150414,"y":0.85370608799602155,"w":0.62393925984700527,"c":1},{"h":0.016344528920266943,"c":1,"x":0.18224996629291637,"t":"we need to practise it so we're sure it won't overrun.","y":0.87075859860162397,"w":0.40515457153320311},{"h":0.013081394761142673,"c":1,"x":0.81957773459242556,"t":"Q29","y":0.86918604676459577,"w":0.036468331019083533},{"t":"I think it should be OK, but yes, let's make sure.","x":0.18042227275761594,"c":1,"y":0.8866279071505172,"h":0.01747303911564102,"w":0.37428021748860685},{"y":0.95058139540870401,"t":"105","w":0.036468331019083644,"x":0.86564299375585696,"h":0.014534883469061177,"c":1}],"w":2400}